      "title": "NOTES",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;\">LOAD</h3>\n\n> CHECKPOINTS (fp16 or fp8)\n>+ [Shuttle 3.1 Aesthetic](https://civitai.com/models/996504?modelVersionId=1116641) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5-10 steps\n>\n>+ [Flux Dev](https://civitai.com/models/618692?modelVersionId=691639) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;20+ steps\n>\n>+ [Flux Schnell](https://civitai.com/models/618692?modelVersionId=699279) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5-10 steps\n>\n>\n> CLIP\n>+ [Clip G](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-diffusion-3.5-fp8/blob/main/text_encoders/clip_g.safetensors)\n>+ [Clip L](https://huggingface.co/zer0int/CLIP-GmP-ViT-L-14/blob/main/ViT-L-14-TEXT-detail-improved-hiT-GmP-HF.safetensors)\n>+ [T5-XXL](https://civitai.com/models/704429/flux-t-5-xxl-textencoder-fp16)\n>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;\">LORA</h3>\n\n>+ Triggerwords will be saved in root folder in a loras_tag.json file.    \n>+ Set strength to 0 (zero), or use \"bypass\" for unused Lora Loaders  \n>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;\">SCHEDULERS AND SAMPLERS</h3>\n\n> SHEDULERS\n>+ Normal\n>+ sgm_uniform\n>+ Simple\n>+ Beta  \n>\n> SAMPLERS\n>+ Euler\n>+ heunpp2\n>+ dpm2\n>+ deis\n>"
      ],
